{"game": "terminull-brigade", "language": "english", "appid": 3104410, "month": "2025-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1758585600, "end_date": 1759276799, "month_true_total": 129, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 02:32:00 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "205578476", "author": {"steamid": "76561198830207300", "personaname": "YourYumia", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/your-yumia/", "num_games_owned": 94, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 309, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 309, "last_played": 1759272965, "avatar": "abe809698972768d6d739c8359b2f6d2e77645d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'd like to start by saying that, for a roguelite, this game's gameplay is fine but uninspired. The game's difficulty is sincerely lacking and the base loop leaves a lot to be desired. Moreover, the game has an outright predatory and misleading monetisation scheme. The game just doesn't feel like something that's loved by its developers nor does the game convey the sense that the developers/publisher care about anyone playing this game. If you enjoy that's sweet but, please don't waste your money on this project.", "timestamp_created": 1759273428, "timestamp_updated": 1759273428, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205548749", "author": {"steamid": "76561199098653802", "personaname": "Maj0r Aut1sm0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199098653802/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 488, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 399, "last_played": 1772062598, "avatar": "f244fa14ff4bcc17eacf027842cacaa0d9d0f985