 "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/The1oni0us/", "num_games_owned": 151, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1250, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 633, "last_played": 1759437045, "avatar": "16c3ec87d4bf17c4c9e9f6befee90d814a9ff700"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is honestly very fun, too bad so many people have had game-breaking performance issues. Hopefully the devs sort that stuff out and the game is able to thrive in the future - very low player counts currently.", "timestamp_created": 1759142405, "timestamp_updated": 1759142405, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205426867", "author": {"steamid": "76561199385396672", "personaname": "Surshana", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199385396672/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 51, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 51, "last_played": 1759086587, "avatar": "85cf852e989974df60eeecf1aae1e1a853e8daee"}, "language": "english", "review": "game seems like it could be lots of fun but honestly seems like they prioritized the business model before the game. also doesn't have full controller support which is crazy. also WAY too many stutters even on low graphic settings. hell the startup splash screens were stuttering. the CUTSCENES were stuttering.", "timestamp_created": 1759089827, "timestamp_updated": 1759089827, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205424758", "author": {"steamid": "76561199079797772", "personaname": "kowo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/supremewaifu/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 657, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 657, "last_played": 1759086514, "avatar": "8917a4da39cfd4e94092dc669c65628b4ac766aa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Please don't waste your time or hard drive space on this soulless \"game\". \r\n\r\n-The animations are nothing to rave about especially with the constant drops in frame rate. \r\n-Character designs are generic.\r\n-Skins are blatant rip offs from other games (i.e KDA in League of Legends)\r\n-Gameplay is repetitive and uninspired.\r\n-Everything lags. Everything. Even just being in the login screen there is constantly stuttering.\r\n-Most cosmetics are locked behind paywalls and a gacha system.\r\n-Loot is useless.\r\n\r\nTo be honest, this game will probably EoS in less than a year. \r\nYour time is valuable, do not give it to a game that doesn't respect nor value it.", "timestamp_created": 1759087973, "timestamp_updated": 1759087973, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.511656343936920166", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}]}